pseudo-Boolean proof version 3.0
% Regression test: `Clause::lower_rhs` escalated by calling `lower_rhs` on a
% `GeneralPBConstraint::<BigInt>` *temporary*. A BigInt `checked_sub` never
% fails, so the callee lowered the temporary in place and returned `None` --
% the caller's signal that the receiver was already mutated -- and the `-` step
% was silently a no-op that left the un-lowered `>= 1` on the stack.
f 1 ;
pol 1 18446744073709551616 - ;
e 1 x1 1 x2 >= -18446744073709551615 : 2 ;
output NONE;
conclusion NONE;
end pseudo-Boolean proof;
